fixup! Wave 1, place: Back returns to the same spot; typing and open sections are kept

- Erase and restore in Settings forget the typing kept for the old plan (planner:erased; place.forgetAll), and a kept
  line never names a form drawn on the page another way (its typing goes, said once).
- The fingers on the screen are counted from each touch event (a touchend sent to a removed element no longer leaves
  the room under the page for good), and the 8 s cap lets the room go whatever the count.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FKTjPFbzEx2ZvP4BhqKEiS
